<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108390" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποζύγι-ον</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ζῠ]</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beast for the
				yoke, beast of draught</i> or <i>burden,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				873e
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.167
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.24
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				41
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποζύγια καλούμενα πάντα ὁμοίως,
					βοῦς, ἡμιόνους, ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					18.4
				</span></i>
			: as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποζύγιαι ἡμίονοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.Byz.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1625.41
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ζῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMasp.</u>
					2 ii 3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later specifically <i>an ass,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Za.</u>
				9.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				21.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Pet.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμίονοι καὶ ὑποζύγια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					158
				</span></i>
			, <span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς ἢ ὑ. ἢ πρόβατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					3p.56
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρον οἷον ὑποζυγίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.70
				</span></i>
			.</div>
